 ders Ben Shown and Matt Kissick for an interactive workshop on facilitatio
 n\, collaboration\, and workshop design. Drawing on experience working wit
 h organizations such as Google\, Microsoft\, NASA\, Expedia\, and The New 
 York Times\, the session will explore practical methods for planning and l
 eading effective workshops that foster creativity\, alignment\, and meanin
 gful outcomes. Participants will gain valuable insights and hands-on strat
 egies for facilitating impactful design conversations and collaborative pr
 oblem-solving. Registration is required and space is limited.
