BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MAKING IT! series: Max Dean X Micah Lexier
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261117T123020
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261117T140031
UID:making-it-series-max-dean-x-micah-lexier@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:MAKING IT! Interview Series\n\nMaking It! Arts Professional Ca
 reer Development Series: MAKING IT! In collaboration with artists Max Dean
  and Micah Lexier Tuesday\, November 17\, 12:30 to 2 pm 100 McCaul St.\, 5
 th floor\, Room 544 Public welcome We are thrilled to welcome Max Dean and
  Micah Lexier as our first guests for MAKING IT! MAKING IT! is an intervie
 w series hosted by OCAD U students and alumni that explores the realities 
 of the professional art world and what it takes to build a sustainable car
 eer as a working artist. Max Dean is a Canadian multidisciplinary artist b
 ased in Toronto whose work spans photography\, performance\, video\, sculp
 ture\, and installation. His practice explores the relationships between a
 rt\, technology\, and human experience. Throughout his decades-long career
 \, Dean has exhibited internationally\, including at the Venice Biennale\,
  and received the Governor General's Award in Visual and Media Arts in 201
 4. Micah Lexier is a Toronto-based conceptual artist and curator whose pra
 ctice encompasses sculpture\, drawing\, photography\, public art\, curatio
 n\, and publishing. His work explores notions of identity and representati
 on. Throughout his extensive career\, Lexier has exhibited internationally
  and received the Governor General's Award in Visual and Media Arts in 201
 5. Join us for an engaging conversation about the realities of building a 
 career in the art world\, and hear firsthand experiences and insights from
  a life in art. Making connections\, making art\, making money. MAKING IT!
  The Making It! Arts Professional Career Development Series is made possib
 le through the Peter Dalglish Career Development Series\, generously suppo
 rted by The Dalglish Family Foundation.
LOCATION:Main Building & Rosalie Sharp Centre for Design (MCA) 100 McCaul 
 Street 100 McCaul St 5th floor\, Room 544
URL:https://www.ocadu.ca/events-and-exhibitions/making-it-series-max-dean-
 x-micah-lexier
X-SOURCE:OCAD University
END:VEVENT
